cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MagniData in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MagniData"
abstract: >-
  Open-source explorer for image datasets. A deterministic feature extractor turns a folder of images, optionally
  with COCO segmentation annotations, into a table of per-image quality, complexity and coverage metrics; a Flask API
  and a React dashboard browse images and segmentation masks, filter by those metrics, and show embeddings in 3D
  (PCA, t-SNE, clusters). Per-image training losses join the same views as dataset axes.
authors:
  - name: "Precision AI"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Precision-AI-Inc/magnidata"
url: "https://huggingface.co/spaces/precisionaiinc/magnidata"
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - image datasets
  - dataset curation
  - data visualization
  - embeddings
  - image segmentation
